{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara049_1","scaleY":1,"mirrow":false,"x":50,"trans":false,"y":-350,"noOut":false,"bright":1,"addImg":"chara049_1_face_chara049_1a","noIn":false},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara049_1","scaleY":1,"mirrow":false,"x":50,"transTime":0,"trans":false,"y":-350,"noOut":false,"bright":1,"addImg":"chara049_1_face_chara049_1a","nonStandBright":false,"noIn":false,"timeBak":300},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"菲莉娜","text":"[show]比我的营地可精致多了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"菲莉娜","text":"[show]真亏你们能光靠两只手就在野外建起来设施这么齐全的营地……我的营地就只有帐篷和篝火，连栅栏都没有呢！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"菲莉娜","text":"[show]说起来你们的帐篷好像也比我的要精致，我看到的时候老羡慕了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"菲莉娜","text":"[show]工匠真好啊，随便造点什么就能提升生活品质……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara049_1_face_chara049_1e"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"菲莉娜","text":"[show]不过猎人也不差！虽然我是造不出舒服的帐篷，但我能猎到好吃的肉！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"菲莉娜","text":"[show]对了，要不今晚烤肉怎么样？就这么说定了！我这就去“准备食材”吧！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"script":"sj_049_01","des":"菲莉娜-对我们的营地感觉如何？"}